WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
Juri guards Ryu’s OD Shoryuken before the punish.

2
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.650
Forward heavy scores the raw-Rush Punish Counter.

3
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.750
Crouching heavy punch cancels into OD Go Ohsatsu.

4
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.750
Forward medium leads into the enhanced heavy, light and medium chain.

5
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:07.250
A second forward-medium link leads to unstocked Go Ohsatsu.

6
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:16.750
Kaisen Dankairaku catches Ryu after the unstocked heavy special.

7
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.350
The normal-health Level 3 ends in a hard knockdown.
